UID:6a394c6d8ea300e2631f70eb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience an hour of calming\, meditative music featuring the
  soothing sounds of Japanese shakuhachi flute and piano. This immersive 
 “sound bath” by Debbie Danbrook and Steve Raiman is designed to promot
 e relaxation and wellbeing.\nDebbie Danbrook is a master shakuhachi flute
  player and co-founder of Music Can Heal\, a non-profit organization th
 at inspires healing through live music. Pianist Steve Raiman has spent ov
 er 40 years performing healing and relaxation music and has toured extensi
 vely throughout Japan. Together\, the duo creates a peaceful musical exp
 erience using original compositions from their Healing Music recordings.\n
 Audience members can expect an uplifting and restorative experience.\nDrop
 -in\, no registration required.
