UID:6a2af078414ef43d00967bbb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An inspiring storytelling performance of a Sufi story that is 
 rooted in the literary and folk traditions of West and Central Asia\, and 
 the Middle East.  Acclaimed storyteller\, Ariel Balevi\, tells a story fro
 m “Conference of the Birds\, or\n“Mantiq – ut – Tayr”\, which is
 \nthe most beloved epic poem of the 12\nth\ncentury Persian poet and Sufi 
 writer\, Farid-al-din Attar.\nThe poem tells the story of the struggles of
  humankind to attain wisdom\, discover absolute truth\, and reach eternal 
 enlightenment.
