BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Writing About Your Work: Arts Mentor in Residence Series with Elai
 ne Chan-Dow
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T173000
UID:6a3d61b786636e3d00509733@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Writing clearly about your work is an important part of buildi
 ng a sustainable creative practice. In this workshop on artist statements 
 and accessible writing\, learn how to write about your projects in a way t
 hat is engaging\, professional and easy to understand. Participants will a
 lso discuss practical and ethical approaches to using AI-assisted writing 
 tools within creative practice.\nThis program will be followed by a Q&A.
 \nThis workshop is presented by transdisciplinary artist\, educator and re
