BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Obstacle is the Phone: Stoic Focus in a Distracted Digital Wor
 ld
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T193000
UID:6a206482f56bd86e00b44522@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In an era of constant pings\, pop‑ups\, and pressure to stay
  connected\, our attention is pulled in every direction—yet most advice 
 focuses on screen‑time guilt rather than building real inner skills. Thi
 s interactive workshop offers a fresh approach grounded in the Stoic disci
 plines of Perception\, Action\, and Will. Through practical strategies\, y
 ou’ll explore how to notice digital pulls clearly\, respond with intenti
 on\, and stay aligned with your values amid everyday digital noise.\nInfor
 mation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collec
 ted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, section
 s 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event a
 nd program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the
